  "_source": "Sunken Kingdom / Principality of Stone Codex p.36–37 (same diagram in both)",
  "steps": [
   "Standard Preparations (Rulebook p.44)",
   "Monster Positioning: Put numbered base rings on all Ratwolf miniatures. Randomly place Ratwolf miniatures numbered 1–4 on the spaces designated on the diagram. Note the facing direction indicated by the arrows. Then, place 4 BP 1 cards face down in a random order on spaces 1–4 on the Mob track.",
   "Additional Setup: Depending on the Kingdom, take the Parasite Bed (Principality of Stone) or Bile and Poison (Sunken Kingdom) Trait card. Follow additional Clash Setup instructions introduced by Traits (if any)."
